### =========================
### DEPOSIT TESTS
### =========================

### Positive test: User can deposit valid amount
### Expected result: 200 OK
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/deposit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic a2F0ZTE5OTg5OnZlcnlzVFJvbmdQYXNzd29yZDMzJDg=

{
  "id": 3,
  "balance": 100
}

### Negative test: User cannot deposit zero amount
### Expected result: 400 Bad Request
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/deposit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic a2F0ZTE5OTg5OnZlcnlzVFJvbmdQYXNzd29yZDMzJDg=

{
  "id": 3,
  "balance": 0
}

### Negative test: User cannot deposit negative amount
### Expected result: 400 Bad Request
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/deposit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic a2F0ZTE5OTg5OnZlcnlzVFJvbmdQYXNzd29yZDMzJDg=

{
  "id": 3,
  "balance": -100
}

### Negative test: User cannot deposit more than 5000
### Expected result: 400 Bad Request
### Actual result: 200 OK
### BUG: API allows deposit amount 5001
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/deposit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic a2F0ZTE5OTg5OnZlcnlzVFJvbmdQYXNzd29yZDMzJDg=

{
  "id": 3,
  "balance": 5001
}

### Negative test: User cannot deposit to non-existing account
### Expected result: 404 Not Found
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/deposit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic a2F0ZTE5OTg5OnZlcnlzVFJvbmdQYXNzd29yZDMzJDg=

{
  "id": 999999,
  "balance": 100
}

