### =========================
### PROFILE NAME TESTS
### =========================

### Positive test: User can update profile name
### Expected result: 200 OK

PUT http://localhost:4111/api/v1/customer/profile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic a2F0ZTE5OTg5OnZlcnlzVFJvbmdQYXNzd29yZDMzJDg=

{
  "name": "Eddie Davidson"
}

### Negative test: User cannot update profile name with one word
### Expected result: 400 Bad Request
### Actual result: 200 OK
### BUG: API allows profile name with one word

PUT http://localhost:4111/api/v1/customer/profile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic a2F0ZTE5OTg5OnZlcnlzVFJvbmdQYXNzd29yZDMzJDg=

{
  "name": "Eddie"
}

### Negative test: User cannot update profile name with numbers
### Expected result: 400 Bad Request
### Actual result: 200 OK
### BUG: API allows numbers in profile name

PUT http://localhost:4111/api/v1/customer/profile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic a2F0ZTE5OTg5OnZlcnlzVFJvbmdQYXNzd29yZDMzJDg=

{
  "name": "Eddie786 Davidson"
}

### Negative test: User cannot update profile name with special characters
### Expected result: 400 Bad Request
### Actual result: 200 OK
### BUG: API allows special characters in profile name

PUT http://localhost:4111/api/v1/customer/profile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic a2F0ZTE5OTg5OnZlcnlzVFJvbmdQYXNzd29yZDMzJDg=

{
  "name": "Eddie @Davidson"
}

### Negative test: User cannot update profile name with empty value
### Expected result: 400 Bad Request
### Actual result: 200 OK
### BUG: API allows empty profile name

PUT http://localhost:4111/api/v1/customer/profile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic a2F0ZTE5OTg5OnZlcnlzVFJvbmdQYXNzd29yZDMzJDg=

